  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062905/assets/4229e1e8c92803a4d51043442a8bc65a6560e11a1e7559af7ec4246fe3005e75.png)\n\nConsider the linear transformation that acts on vectors in ${R}^{2}$ as follows (in the order given):\n\n- it rotates vectors by ${45}^{\u2218}$ clockwise about the origin, and then\n\n- reflects the result in the $y$-axis.\n\nWhat is the image of the unit square shown above under the action of the linear transformation?",
