  "html": "<div id=\"step-q82527\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 2</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-82527\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Consider the linear transformation that acts on vectors in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"19\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as follows (in the order given):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>it rotates vectors by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"20\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.404em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>45</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>\u2218</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> clockwise about the origin, and then </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>reflects the result in the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>What is the image of the unit square shown above under the action of the linear transformation?</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82527-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-82527-a-2\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82527-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-82527-a-3\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82527-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-82527-a-1\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82527-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-82527-a-4\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82527-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-82527-a-5\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questio